s":"counting"}],"gloss":"counting","split_unverified":true}]},{"words":[{"surface":"சிலையின்","parts":[{"text":"சிலை","lemma":"cilai","gloss":"bow"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"iṉ","gloss":"with"}],"gloss":"with the bow"},{"surface":"மாற்றியோனே","parts":[{"text":"மாற்றியோனே","lemma":"மாற்றியோனே","gloss":"he who turned them back"}],"gloss":"he who turned them back","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"அவைதாம்","parts":[{"text":"அவை","lemma":"avai","gloss":"those (cattle)"},{"text":"தாம்","lemma":"tām","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"those cattle indeed"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"மிகப்பல","parts":[{"text":"மிக","lemma":"mika","gloss":"very"},{"text":"பல","lemma":"pala","gloss":"many"}],"gloss":"very many"},{"surface":"ஆயினும்","parts":[{"text":"ஆயினும்","lemma":"āku","gloss":"even if they are"}],"gloss":"even if they are"},{"surface":"என்னாம்","parts":[{"text":"என்","lemma":"eṉ","gloss":"what"},{"text":"ஆம்","lemma":"ām","gloss":"will become"}],"gloss":"what is the use?"},{"surface":"எனைத்தும்","parts":[{"text":"எனைத்து","lemma":"eṉaittu","gloss":"how much"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"um","gloss":"even"}],"gloss":"even a little bit"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"வெண்கோள்","parts":[{"text":"வெண்கோள்","lemma":"வெண்கோள்","gloss":"white spots of butter"}],"gloss":"white spots of butter","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"தோன்றாக்","parts":[{"text":"தோன்றாக்","lemma":"தோன்றாக்","gloss":"not appearing"}],"gloss":"not appearing","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"குழிசியடு","parts":[{"text":"குழிசியடு","lemma":"குழிசியடு","gloss":"with the pot"}],"gloss":"with the pot","split_unverified":true}]},{"words":[{"surface":"நாள்உறை","parts":[{"text":"நாள்","lemma":"nāḷ","gloss":"day/fresh"},{"text":"உறை","lemma":"uṟai","gloss":"curd"}],"gloss":"daily curd"},{"surface":"மத்தொலி","parts":[{"text":"மத்து","lemma":"mattu","gloss":"churning rod"},{"text":"ஒலி","lemma":"oli","gloss":"sound"}],"gloss":"sound of the churning rod"},{"surface":"கேளாதோனே","parts":[{"text":"கேளாதோனே","lemma":"கேளாதோனே","gloss":"he who does not hear"}],"gloss":"he who does not hear","split_unverified":true}]}],"literal":"His calf like a small pebble inside a sandal, / with a beautiful belly, a wide chest, and fierce eyes, / with a chin of thick hair arranged like sticks, / with cheeks hanging down past his ears, along with his bow, / who indeed is he? Pitiable is he himself, if we consider. / He did not depart far from his village, / nor did he take refuge in the forest as a fortress. In the morning, / looking at the retreating backs of the enemies' herds of cattle, / pointing with his hand, counting them slowly, / he turned them back with his bow. Those cattle, / even if they are very many, what is the use? Even a little bit, / in the pot where no white butter-spots appear, / the sound of the churning rod in the daily curd, he does not hear.","translation":"With calves as tough as a pebble stuck inside a sandal, a small belly, a broad chest, and fierce eyes, his chin covered in a stiff, bristly beard like closely packed sticks, and cheeks hanging low past his ears, he stands with his bow. Who is he? If you think about it, he is a simple, pitiable man. He never went far from his village, nor did he ever flee to the forest for safety. Yet, this morning, seeing the retreating backs of the enemy's cattle herds, he pointed with his hand, counted them slowly, and turned them all back with his bow. But what is the use of those captured cattle, however numerous they may be? He lies dead now, never to hear even the faint sound of the churning rod in the daily curd pot of his poor home, where white spots of butter never even had a chance to form.","modern":"செருப்புக்குள் இருக்கும் சிறு கல்லைப் போன்ற உறுதியான கணுக்காலையும், அழகிய வயிற்றையும், அகன்ற மார்பையும், கடிய கண்களையும் உடையவன். குச்சிகளை அடுக்கிவைத்தது போன்ற அடர்ந்த தாடி மயிரைக் கொண்ட தாடையும், காதுகளைத் தாண்டித் தொங்கும் கன்னங்களும் கொண்ட அவன் தன் வில்லோடு நிற்கிறான். ஆராய்ந்து பார்த்தால் அவன் மிகவும் எளியவன், இரங்கத்தக்கவன். அவன் தன் ஊரை விட்டுத் தாண்டிப் போனதும் இல்லை; பாதுகாப்பிற்காகக் காட்டைத் தஞ்சமடைந்ததும் இல்லை. ஆனால் இன்று காலையில், பகைவர்களின் பின்வாங்கிச் செல்லும் பசுக்கூட்டங்களைக் கண்டு, தன் கையால் சுட்டிக் காட்டி, மெதுவாக எண்ணி, தன் வில்லால் அவற்றைத் திருப்பி ஓட்டி வந்தான். அந்தப் பசுக்கள் மிகப்பலவாக இருந்தாலும் அவனுக்கு என்ன பயன்? வெண்ணெய் திரளாத வறிய பானையில், அன்றாடத் தயிரைக் கடையும் மத்தின் ஒலியைக் கூடக் கேட்க முடியாதபடி அவன் இறந்துபோனானே!","explanation":"This poem belongs to the Veṭci tiṇai (cattle raiding) and the theme is Uṇṭāṭṭu, which here takes the form of a tragic lament for a fallen hero. The poet describes a brave but extremely poor young warrior who successfully retrieved a large herd of cattle stolen by enemies. He is described with rugged, fierce physical features: tough calves like a pebble in a shoe, a bristly beard, and hanging jowls, showing his rustic and hardy nature. Despite his valor in turning back the entire herd using just his bow, he lost his life in the battle. The tragedy is highlighted by his poverty: he came from a home so poor that their daily curd pot never showed any white spots of butter, and now he will never even hear the humble sound of churning again. The contrast between the \"very many\" cattle he captured and the utter lack of butter in his own home underscores the selfless heroism and tragic fate of the common soldier.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.8],[0.8,1.3],[1.3,1.6],[1.6,2.1],[2.1,2.7],[2.7,3.1],[3.1,3.7],[3.7,4.1],[4.1,5.4],[5.4,5.8],[5.8,6.4],[6.4,6.8],[6.8,8.25],[8.25,8.7],[8.7,8.9],[8.9,9.5],[9.5,9.95],[9.95,10.4],[10.4,10.8],[10.8,11.5],[11.5,12.07],[12.07,12.86],[12.86,13.2],[13.5,13.7],[14.03,14.64],[14.64,15.57],[15.57,16.03],[16.03,16.49],[16.49,17.1],[17.1,17.54],[17.54,18.1],[18.1,18.5],[19.24,19.74],[19.74,20.05],[20.05,20.2],[20.24,20.84],[20.84,21.34],[21.34,21.74],[21.84,22.04],[22.04,22.54],[22.54,23.64],[23.64,24.14],[24.14,24.54],[24.6,25.04],[25.04,25.54],[25.84,26.23],[26.23,26.84],[26.84,27.74],[27.97,28.44],[28.44,28.74],[28.74,29.14]],"female":[[0.0,0.9],[0.9,1.5],[1.5,1.9],[1.9,2.67],[2.67,3.23],[3.23,3.6],[3.6,4.2],[4.2,4.7],[4.7,5.11],[5.11,5.52],[5.52,6.13],[6.13,7.13],[7.13,8.63],[8.63,8.99],[8.99,9.7],[9.7,10.6],[10.6,11.2],[11.2,11.8],[11.8,12.3],[12.3,13.0],[13.0,14.3],[14.4,15.0],[15.0,15.67],[15.67,16.1],[16.1,16.66],[16.66,17.5],[17.5,17.92],[17.92,18.1],[18.1,18.75],[18.75,19.4],[19.4,20.3],[20.3,20.8],[21.56,22.26],[22.26,22.76],[22.76,23.02],[23.02,23.36],[23.36,23.96],[23.96,24.39],[24.39,24.65],[24.65,25.16],[25.16,26.36],[26.36,26.86],[26.86,27.26],[27.26,27.76],[27.76,28.06],[28.06,28.36],[28.36,28.66],[28.66,28.96],[28.96,29.26],[29.26,29.56],[29.56,29.86]]},"sync":[[["செருப்புஇடைச்","inside the sandal"]],[["சிறுபரல்","small pebble"]],[["அன்னன்","he who is like"]],[["கணைக்கால்","tough/muscular calf"]],[["அவ்வயிற்று","of the small belly"]],[["அகன்ற","wide"]],[["மார்பின்","of the chest"]],[["பைங்கண்","fierce eyes"]],[["குச்சின்","like small sticks"]],[["நிரைத்த","closely arranged"]],[["குரூஉமயிர்","thick hair"]],[["மோவாய்ச்","chin/beard"]],[["செவிஇறந்து","passing beyond the ears"]],[["தாழ்தரும்","hanging down"]],[["கவுளன்","he of the cheeks"]],[["வில்லொடு","with a bow"]],[["யார்கொலோ","who indeed?"]],[["அளியன்","pitiable/simple man"]],[["தானே","himself"]],[["தேரின்","if one considers"]],[["ஊர்பெரிது","far from the village"]],[["இகந்தன்றும்","even departed"]],[["இலனே","he is not"]],[["அரண்எனக்","as a fortress"]],[["காடுகைக்","taking refuge in the forest"]],[["கொண்டன்றும்","even taken"]],[["இலனே","he is not"]],[["காலைப்","in the morning"]],[["புல்லார்","enemies"]],[["இனநிரை","herds of cattle"]],[["செல்புறம்","retreating backs"]],[["நோக்கிக்","looking at"]],[["கையின்","with the hand"]],[["சுட்டிப்","pointing"]],[["பைஎன","slowly"]],[["எண்ணிச்","counting"]],[["சிலையின்","with the bow"]],[["மாற்றியோனே","he who turned them back"]],[["மாற்றியோனே","he who turned them back"]],[["அவைதாம்","those cattle indeed"]],[["மிகப்பல","very many"]],[["ஆயினும்